
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@contentType = application/json
@accept = application/json

### 1. CREATE - Tambah Service Baru (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{accept}}

{
  "name": "VPS Starter Pack",
  "price": 150000,
  "description": "Layanan VPS untuk pemula dengan RAM 2GB",
  "status": true
}

### 2. GET ALL - Ambil Semua Data Service
GET {{baseUrl}}/services
Accept: {{accept}}

### 3. GET ALL with Filter - Ambil Service yang Active
GET {{baseUrl}}/services?status=active
Accept: {{accept}}

### 4. SHOW - Ambil Detail Service Berdasarkan ID
# Ganti angka 1 dengan ID yang ada di database kamu
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Accept: {{accept}}

### 5. UPDATE - Ubah Data Service (PUT/PATCH)
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{accept}}

{
  "name": "VPS Ultimate Pro",
  "price": 250000,
  "description": "Upgrade RAM ke 8GB"
}

### 6. DEACTIVATE - Nonaktifkan Service (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/services/1/deactivate
Accept: {{accept}}

### 7. ACTIVATE - Aktifkan Kembali Service (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/services/1/activate
Accept: {{accept}}

### 8. DELETE - Hapus Service
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/1
Accept: {{accept}}
